OL,3,ABurnham calls summit of Welsh, Scottish
OL,4,Aand Northern Irish first ministers
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe prime minister says he will bring
OL,7,Ftogether the first ministers of Wales,
OL,8,FScotland and Northern Ireland in the
OL,9,Fautumn for a summit.
OL,11,FAndy Burnham made the announcement
OL,12,Fahead of a visit to south Wales on
OL,13,FThursday - his first official visit to
OL,14,Fthe country since he took control of
OL,15,Fthe UK government.
OL,17,FThe Labour leader said he wanted "every
OL,18,Fleader in this country signed up" to
OL,19,Fhaving "good jobs in every community".
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
