OL,3,ABurnham calls summit of Welsh, Scottish
OL,4,Aand Northern Irish first ministers
OL,5,
OL,6,FDowning Street said the first ministers
OL,7,Fof Wales and Scotland, and the first
OL,8,Fand deputy first ministers of Northern
OL,9,FIreland will meet the prime minister at
OL,10,Fthe National Economic Council in
OL,11,FOctober.
